	measure VarianceWithouZero = ```
			VAR PrimaryPf__ = VALUES('RptPortfolioBenchmarkVariance'[PFBMCode])
			VAR SecondaryPf__ = VALUES('RptPortfolioBenchmarkVariance'[VariancePFBMCode])
			VAR PrimaryData__ = [PrimaryDataMeasure]
			VAR PFBMType__ = MIN('RptPortfolioBenchmarkVariance'[Type])
			
			VAR SecondaryData__ = 
			IF(
			    PFBMType__ = "3-Variance",
			    [SecondaryDataMeasure],  // Call the secondary measure
			    0
			)
			
			RETURN PrimaryData__-SecondaryData__
			```
		formatString: \$#,0.###############;(\$#,0.###############);\$#,0.###############
		lineageTag: 511ca73c-8826-4538-ae03-68bfe1a967fc

